// Instantaneous line pulse, not a sustained channel -- the school's own
// first "quick pulse" BasicBeam player-spell (contrast
// assets/common/abilities/spells/evocation/caustic_brew.ron/witch_bolt.ron,
// Wave 1, both genuinely sustained Concentration channels). A very short
// `beam_duration` (0.5 s) caps this to essentially one tick regardless of
// how long the input is held, approximating the sheet's single resolved
// line-attack; `energy_drain` is set so that single short window consumes
// roughly this batch's circle-2 single-target energy anchor (acid_arrow.ron,
// 45) rather than draining like a real sustain.
//
// BasicBeam hardcodes DamageKind::Energy in
// common/src/states/basic_beam.rs (no RON-configurable damage_kind field
// exists on this variant) -- so despite the Fire flavor text, this deals
// generic Energy damage under the hood, same drift already documented on
// caustic_brew.ron for its own BasicBeam use.
BasicBeam(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    beam_duration: 0.5,
    damage: 24.0,
    tick_rate: 2.0,
    range: 9.0,
    max_angle: 5.0,
    damage_effect: None,
    energy_regen: 0,
    energy_drain: 90,
    move_efficiency: 0.1,
    ori_rate: 1.0,
    specifier: Flamethrower,
    meta: (school: Some(Evocation), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
